          "path": "/localhome/local-rohing/orch_r205_node3_20260918/lr03/raw/stream/records/00000000000000000555.json",
          "raw": " Sure, let's analyze the `select_rehearsal_rows` function based on the value of `presentations`.\n\n- When `presentations` is `0`, no rows are selected from `old_rows`.\n- When `presentations` is `1`, all rows from `old_rows` are selected.\n- When `presentations` is `absent` (not specified), all rows from `old_rows` are selected, assuming the default value is `1`.\n\n`READY TO ACT`",
